    {
      "predicate": "iadas:limites",
      "object": "First, the sample size was relatively small which likely reduces the generalizability of our conclusions. Related to this issue, the statistical power of the employed regression design could not guarantee a reliable detection of MD predictors; hence, regression findings should be interpreted with caution. Secondly, the online recruitment strategy we adopted under-sampled those without internet capability and prevented the opportunity of conducting face-to-face interviews of participants self-identified as recreational bodybuilders and recreational strength athletes. Lastly, the absence of psychometric information for the MPS is another limitation."
    },
